OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland crisis 'could see all
OL,4,Abusinesses suffer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA potential collapse of Poundland could
OL,7,Fimpact all businesses on the high
OL,8,Fstreet, a West Midlands business owner
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FPoundland has filed a notice of
OL,12,Fintention to appoint administrators,
OL,13,Fwhich protects it from creditors until
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FDr Lewis Haydon runs Raybloc, a
OL,17,Fradiation-shielding specialist firm in
OL,18,FWillenhall. He told the BBC that it has
OL,19,Fbeen a challenging time for businesses
OL,20,Fover the past few years, especially
OL,21,Fsince retailer Wilko collapsed in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
