OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland crisis 'could see all
OL,4,Abusinesses suffer'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a real shame because we need
OL,7,Fthese people to be going to the high
OL,8,Fstreet. [It] is all about income -
OL,9,Fincome for the people [and] income for
OL,10,Fthe businesses on the high street. If
OL,11,Fthat income, the cash flow, isn't
OL,12,Fthere, all businesses suffer."
